---
import TeamWorkIllustration from "./TeamWorkIllustration.astro"
---

<section class="relative w-full overflow-hidden py-32">
	<div
		class="-z-1 absolute -left-1/4 top-1/4 block h-[24%] w-1/2 animate-pulse rounded-full bg-brand-600/60 blur-[125px]"
		style={{ animationDuration: "4s" }}
	>
	</div>
	<div
		class="-z-1 absolute -right-1/4 top-1/4 block h-[24%] w-1/2 animate-pulse rounded-full bg-brand-600/60 blur-[125px]"
		style={{ animationDelay: "1s", animationDuration: "4s" }}
	>
	</div>

	<div class="container flex items-center gap-12 max-lg:flex-col">
		<div class="flex w-full max-w-xl flex-col text-center max-lg:items-center lg:text-left">
			<img
				loading="lazy"
				src="/images/i2tec-logo-wh.webp"
				class="mb-4 w-28 invert dark:invert-0"
				alt="I2TEC Logo"
			/>
			<h1 class="mb-6 text-6xl font-bold text-primary">Buscando la innovación</h1>
			<p class="text-balance">
				Somos el centro de investigaición y innovación de la Universidad Nacional de Loja en la
				ciudad de Loja, ubicado en el sur del Ecuador. Comprometidos a producir soluciones
				tecnológicas de alto impacto.
			</p>
		</div>
		<div class="flex w-full items-center justify-center lg:justify-end">
			<TeamWorkIllustration class="max-w-sm lg:max-w-lg" />
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
